  "sourceTitle": "Champagne Salad",
  "sourceText": "Champagne Salad\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Thursday, February 11, 2010 - 12:15pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n8 ounces cream cheese\ncup sugar\n16 ounces frozen strawberries and juice\n13 ounces Cool Whip\n20 ounces crushed pineapple, well drained\n2 ripe bananas, sliced\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Cream cheese and sugar; add strawberries (thaw a little), pineapple, and bananas. Fold into Cool Whip. Put into 9x13-inch pan and freeze. Take out 30 minutes before serving. 2 Bonnie Jern",
